On every node, in `/etc/tower/conf.d/postgres.py`:
```python
from awx.main.utils import decrypt_value, get_encryption_key
DATABASES = {
    'default': {
        'ENGINE': 'django.db.backends.postgresql',
        'NAME': 'awx', 'USER': 'awx',
        'PASSWORD': decrypt_value(get_encryption_key('value'), '$encrypted$AESCBC$...'),
        'HOST': '127.0.0.1', 'PORT': 5432,
    }
}
```
